        "summary": "The diff is empty (0 files changed against base 7850da1), so there is nothing new to review. I read the base tree to see whether the round-2 fixes are already there, and they are. daemon.py keeps `pool.steering_refusal_reasons` and notifies only when the reasons change. It also caches the promotion check and resets the state outside active mode. steering_policy.read_scope and safe_scope are shared with spawn._packet_body, and safe_scope skips absolute and `..` scope entries. Row-based shadow_n is used in promotion.py. I did not run the tests or check the docs statement about bootstrap on shadow_n. I also did not read decision_log.recent or its per-tick cache closely, so I can't confirm the log-scan fix. The gate result recorded in the packet was green.",
